 "sentences": [
  "Romans grabbed fast food too, and archaeologists found the counter.",
  "It's called a thermopolium, a street-food bar, and Pompeii had about eighty of them.",
  "In 2020, archaeologists finished digging out one on a busy corner.",
  "Its counter is painted with ducks, a rooster and a dog.",
  "In its clay jars they found remains of duck, pig, goat, fish and snails.",
  "It was a lunch spot, sealed by Vesuvius.",
  "Follow for more from Pompeii."
